  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1202.22 Grit",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1202.22 “Grit” means heavy inorganic matter such as stone, gravel, cinders, sand, silt, ashes, and heavy particulate matter such as bone chips and coffee grounds.\n\nSource. #8235, eff 12-22-04 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1200) (formerly Env-Ws 1202.22); ss by #9798-A, eff 10-9-10; ss by #12739, eff 3-19-19",
